OL,3,GNEWSAI was scouted in bookshop for
OL,4,Aleading role in TV ad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says it is "surreal" to see
OL,7,Fherself in a new advert after she was
OL,8,Fscouted in a bookshop where she works.
OL,10,FA film crew spotted Sophie Smith, 25,
OL,11,Fwhile she was working at Sherlock and
OL,12,FPages in Frome, Somerset. A few months
OL,13,Flater, she is now starring in a series
OL,14,Fof new Post Office adverts released
OL,15,Fthis week.
OL,17,FSmith said: "It is really quite
OL,18,Fsurreal. Family and friends have been
OL,19,Ftexting my mum to say they've seen me
OL,20,Fin a TV advert."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
