OL,3,GNEWSAI was scouted in bookshop for
OL,4,Aleading role in TV ad
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset Council chiefs said filming in
OL,7,Fthe area was also good for the economy,
OL,8,Fwith film and TV productions bringing
OL,9,Fabout #6.6m to the county last year.
